  "summary": "Add context-aware rename cleaning with separate persisted movie and TV filter options, terms, and remove-term settings, plus Settings UI controls and backend preview evidence.",
  "reason": "Movie and TV rename cleanup share similar release metadata terms but need different context handling. Title words such as Web, DC, SE, and MA should be preserved when they are part of the title, while TV show/folder and episode tokens need a separate filter catalog.",
